|CKBSwashbuckler|000

|CK0Swashbucklers are agile blade specialists who win through style, timing,
mobility, and nerve. They favour knives and one-handed swords with light armour,
using layered techniques instead of the Fighter's broad equipment approach.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Combat builds Flair, with critical hits and a personally named weapon
creating extra momentum. Finesse determines how many blade techniques can be
sustained together. Alignment affects skill costs, and combining offensive or
defensive styles creates additional strain.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0parry, dodge, riposte, called shot, impale, flurry, flourish, and Dance of
Death form the technique ladder. Slip and press spend Flair, challenge sets the
terms of a duel, wound creates lasting pressure, and nameweapon personalizes a
favoured blade.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Swashbuckler if you enjoy fast blade combat, maintaining several
styles, spending momentum at the right instant, and accepting lighter defenses
in exchange for mobility and flourish.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBsbhelp general|CK0, |CKBsbhelp flair|CK0, and
|CKBsbhelp techniques|CK0 for the full repertoire.|000

